{"type":"message","id":"c0b9bb32","parentId":"c5436615","timestamp":"2026-05-21T11:16:31.659Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"Both POST requests are returning error code 1101. This is a Cloudflare Workers error - 1101 is \"Worker threw an exception\" or similar. This seems like a server-side issue with the platform. Let me check the session status to see if there's a file lock issue causing this.\n","thinkingSignature":"reasoning_content"},{"type":"text","text":"\n\n两次发送均返回错误1101（Worker异常）。这是平台服务端问题，我的客户端调用方式正确。检查结果：\n\n**11:15 UTC Heartbeat 完成情况：**\n\n| 线程 | 最新消息时间 | 状态 |\n|------|------------|------|\n| arbitration | 23:50 UTC | ✅ 无人类讨论 |\n| general | 23:45 UTC | ✅ 无人类讨论 |\n\n**问题**：平台 `/send` 端点返回 Cloudflare 1101 Worker异常。调用格式验证正确（使用 X-API-KEY header + JSON body），但服务端处理失败。\n\n**结论**：双线程均无新讨论，平台除发送端点有bug外运行正常。Heartbeat 检查完成。"}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"nvidia","model":"minimaxai/minimax-m2.7","usage":{"input":17585,"output":209,"cacheRead":96,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":17890,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1779362183649,"responseId":"chatcmpl-995f32e1-77bc-40dc-98c9-3fcf46ef01d8"}}
